  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCOPE BIG - Scalable CSP Optimized Power Plant Engineered with Biomass Integrated Gasification</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the action is to promote sustainable and inclusive growth by developing solar thermal and biomass technologies for application to rural India in collaboration with EU. The action also seeks to develop viable business models and conducive policy environment for adoption of these technologies on large scale. Specifically, the action involves the design, development and implementation of a 3 MW solar thermal  biomass hybrid power plant in the state of Bihar.</narrative>
  </description>
